abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and mathlib formalization of the basic nondegenerate analytic
  Hamiltonian KAM theorem following Arnold (1963), with explicit domain
  regularity hypotheses. The development constructs the iteration,
  invariant analytic tori, original Hamiltonian orbits and a large-measure
  conclusion. This is a preliminary research software snapshot for review;
  final human assessment of correspondence with the mathematical sources
  is pending. The development used AI assistance.
